## Repository layout

The repository uses top-level folders for each workflow area:

```text
.
├── POD_tutorials/          # POD/SPOD notebooks + helper script
├── java_macros/            # STAR-CCM+ Java macros and shell runners
├── postprocessing/         # Mass-flow processing pipeline, case data, outputs
├── figures/
├── presentations/
└── refs/
```

### `postprocessing/` structure

`postprocessing/` contains both the CLI pipeline and case-study data/results. Current contents include:

```text
postprocessing/
├── massflow_processing_pipeline.py
├── csvChecker.py
├── nonporous_core_gaps/
│   └── linear_k-eps/
│       ├── FApitch_over12/
│       └── fine_mesh_02112026/
├── porous_full_core/
│   ├── cubic_k-eps/
│   │   ├── FApitch_over12/
│   │   └── FApitch_over14/
│   └── linear_k-eps/
│       ├── FApitch_over10/
│       └── FApitch_over12/
└── outputs/
    └── analysis_*/
```

